@baseUrl=http://localhost:5000/api/v1/reviews

### GET reviews (optionally ?userId=<user_id>)
GET {{baseUrl}}

### GET review by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/REPLACE_WITH_REVIEW_ID

### POST review
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "user_id": "REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID",
    "product_id": "REPLACE_WITH_PRODUCT_ID",
    "rating": 5,
    "comment": "Excellent build quality and very responsive controls."
}

### PUT review by id
PUT {{baseUrl}}/REPLACE_WITH_REVIEW_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "rating": 4,
    "comment": "Updated review comment."
}

### DELETE review by id
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/REPLACE_WITH_REVIEW_ID